      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7515071::rubric_mechanisms::000::0b8973d716"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The titanium-alloyed coating will have better wear resistance than the unchanged FeNiCrCoCu coating under identical test conditions.",
