      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7515071::rubric_mechanisms::000::0b8973d716"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Formation of a stable protective oxide film is more pronounced at high temperatures than at lower temperatures.",
